{"seq":18,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/zero-lean-mcp-instructions-opus-gbrain-mu-v03-dev2/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r3","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T08:08:10.946Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"74ebafa6106c04d78e18f82f7f6fa41cfcd4bad0a4243bb53cad7abd8f372e93","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","text":"Hi Hollis. I went through all six of Moss's notes (the digests under teams/team-north and teams/team-central). Only two Quarrendon Freight Lines ticket numbers come up:\n\n1. *#4419*: from \"Moss: North cheat sheet (undated)\" (teams/team-north/digests/north-account-cheatsheet.md). Thea Ramaswell logged it because the gatehouse barcode scanners weren't reading trailer tags at Door 14 on third shift. It was escalated to tier-2 support for scanner firmware testing.\n2. *#PD-4492*: from \"Moss: Sunday prep for Ruth\" (teams/team-north/digests/2025-10-05-north-sunday.md). Thea submitted it on 4 Oct 2025 because drivers at the Eau Claire yard (Doors 14–18, 04:00 shift) weren't getting their SMS bay assignments. Support patched it that evening, and Thea confirmed the next morning that it was fixed.\n\nThings to watch before this goes in the deck:\n• #4419 also shows up in Marcus's note \"Q2 expansion wrap\" (members/marcus-lindqvist/notes, 14 Jul 2025), but he describes it as *Gate 3 BOL printer lag*, not a scanner problem. That note isn't Moss's, and the two descriptions don't match. Check with Dana or support which one is right.\n• Moss's other QFL notes (the 9/14 pipeline digest and the 3/23 renewal check-in) don't mention any ticket numbers.\n• Ignore #4409 and #4412 in the Central handoffs digest. Those are for Pree's Marrow Fieldworks dealer account, not QFL. And \"Quarendon Freightways\" (one r) is a different company and not a customer.\n\nThese are just what Moss's notes say. I didn't check them against the support system."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
{"seq":19,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/zero-lean-mcp-instructions-opus-gbrain-mu-v03-dev2/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r3","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T08:08:16.744Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"f118230de62c1bbbd1a6f520c4c03016ca30daeedb9973f1a09242212eedb536","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","text":"I've sent Hollis the list in his DM. Moss's six notes mention only two Quarrendon Freight Lines ticket numbers:\n\n1. **#4419**, from Moss's undated North cheat sheet (`teams/team-north/digests/north-account-cheatsheet.md`). Thea Ramaswell logged it because the gatehouse barcode scanners weren't reading trailer tags at Door 14 on third shift. It was escalated to tier-2 support for scanner firmware testing.\n2. **#PD-4492**, from Moss's 5 Oct 2025 \"Sunday prep for Ruth\" digest (`teams/team-north/digests/2025-10-05-north-sunday.md`). Thea logged it on 4 Oct 2025 because drivers at the Eau Claire yard weren't getting their text messages telling them which dock door to use. Support patched it that evening, and Thea confirmed the next morning that it was fixed.\n\nI flagged three things to him before it goes in the deck:\n- **#4419 doesn't match across notes.** Marcus's 14 Jul 2025 note (not one of Moss's) describes #4419 as printer lag at Gate 3, not a scanner problem. I suggested he check with Dana or support which one is right.\n- **No other numbers.** Moss's other two Quarrendon Freight Lines notes (the 9/14 pipeline digest and the 3/23 renewal check-in) don't list any ticket numbers.\n- **Not this account.** Tickets #4409 and #4412 in the Central handoffs digest belong to Pree's Marrow Fieldworks account. \"Quarendon Freightways\" (one r) is a different company and isn't a customer.\n\nI told him these come only from Moss's notes and haven't been checked against the support system.\n\nAll of these notes are public files Hollis can open himself, and ticket numbers aren't finance figures, so no approval was needed. I didn't send any mail."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","ts":"1791987000.000125"}}
